<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7369" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάρμοστ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not fitting,</i> of dress,
				<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.10.13
			</span></i>; of sound, <i>out of tune,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				80a
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐάρμοστος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Tht.</u>
				178d
			</span></i>: metaph. of the soul, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phd.</u>
				93c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Smp.</u>
				206c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					206d
				</span></i>
			; <i>incongruous,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταβολὴ ἀ. τοῖς θεοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					3.27
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					590b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons,
				<i>impracticable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.80
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				908
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unfitted, unprepared,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.67
				</span></i>
			.</div>
